WEBVTT

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.470
Oh, this is nostalgic!

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.760
It's from the first time I went riding with Ponta-kun.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:14.500
And the first time I ate gelato at Iida Dairy Farm.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:18.050
Now, I'm a regular there.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.750
Here's the seafood bowl we had at Miura Peninsula!

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.000
It was so delicious!

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.250
And Mt. Fuji...

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.750
I'm feeling moved just reminiscing about it!

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.530
This is the time at Yabitsu Pass.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:44.230
My leg cramped up on the way, and I had to give up.

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:47.030
Yabitsu Pass...

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:42.950
Good work.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.560
Thank you, you too.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.140
How are you holding up?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.260
I'm totally fine.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.520
Did you enjoy the ride?

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:53.190
Today was super fun, as always!

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:57.270
Ami, you've gotten quite used to your road bike.

00:02:57.270 --> 00:02:58.120
Yes!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:03.280
I trained on the Sakae river path every day.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:06.410
Oh, my. Good for you, Ami-chan!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:11.140
I want to catch up to everyone as much as I can.

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.420
Good work, everyone!

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.920
Saki-san, you were great out there!

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:18.560
Where should we go for next week's tour?

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:21.180
Well, let's see...

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.680
Any suggestions?

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.930
Well...

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:29.430
We've done most of the major routes nearby.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.980
Nothing jumps out at me.

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:35.190
Yeah...

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:37.440
Um...

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:42.820
I think I've improved quite a bit
since switching to a road bike.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:45.660
That's true.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.660
So... I...

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.670
I'd really like to try Yabitsu Pass again!

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:54.740
Yabitsu?

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:59.880
That's right.
You couldn't complete the route we planned.

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:05.530
I guess it might be rough near Minoge.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:08.040
We made it past there the last time, but...

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.320
I'm all for it.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:19.860
Then we have to stop at the cafe just beyond Yabitsu!

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:21.240
Sounds great!

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:24.700
Then...!

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.950
Then next week, we get revenge on Yabitsu!

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:30.500
All right!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:35.960
And so...

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:38.690
I've come for revenge on Yabitsu!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:51.940
This really is tough, even with a road bike.

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:55.270
Just what you'd expect from the most grueling section of Yabitsu Pass.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:00.620
But I've ridden a lot since then.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:03.400
And I've prepared so that I won't make the same mistakes again.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:07.830
I'm not the same person I was back then!

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:08.780
Ami!

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:12.290
Relax! As long as we're doing this,

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:13.850
let's enjoy it!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.550
Okay!

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:27.930
The view is awesome!

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:29.990
We've passed the spot...

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:30.700
What?

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.060
where you turned back last time.

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:37.690
Now that you mention it...

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:57.340
From here, it's just a short ride to the summit.

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.330
All right!

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:07.900
Have you been to that new bicycle shop?

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.950
No, not yet.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:12.850
Hinako-chan and I were talking about how much we wanted to go, but...

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:14.380
Hey!

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:16.160
Here they come!

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:18.580
Hey!

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:19.810
Go for it!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:22.290
Ami-chan, you're almost there!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:22.290
Hang in there, Ami!

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:24.910
You can do it!

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:26.320
Just a little more!

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:40.710
I...

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:43.260
I made it!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.730
I conquered the Pass!

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:48.940
You did it, Ami!

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.440
Thank you!

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:53.600
It's all thanks to my road bike.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.730
You can't climb Yabitsu with a road bike alone.

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:02.570
You conquered Yabitsu because
your abilities have been growing too.

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:03.840
Absolutely right!

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.410
It's so hot!

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:15.330
And so...

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:17.890
Congratulations, Ami!

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:20.920
What's this?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:23.670
Just a little present.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:26.550
It's Youkan, for replenishing your energy. It's really tasty.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:28.760
Let's keep riding together!

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:32.450
You guys...

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:33.930
From me...

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:35.930
this!

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:38.560
Th-This is...

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.940
the same thing I had the first time we met...

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.160
That's right,

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:46.690
the taste is a little... well...
but it's a quick and effective supplement.

00:07:47.970 --> 00:07:50.100
It brings back memories.

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:53.360
Everyone, thank you so much!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:57.940
Now then... I'm going to have some right now!

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:03.550
It's so sweet!

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.720
But this is sheer bliss!

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:09.790
I feel like I can cycle as far as I want!

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.660
Oh really? Then that means...

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:17.460
If you can conquer Yabitsu...

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.230
How about Tsubaki Line...

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.480
want to let her try that 20-kilo climb?

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:26.280
Umm... If you raise the bar all of a sudden,
I don't think I can...

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:28.960
20 kilometers uphill is...

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:31.740
Yabitsu is still pretty much my limit.

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.710
Don't worry! Don't worry!

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:36.370
It's quite a distance,
but the slope isn't that bad.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:40.040
Those smiles of yours are what's scaring me.

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.400
What a sight...

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:52.600
Yeah.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:56.170
I wonder if they're doing some team practice...

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:59.490
Are those team uniforms?

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:02.750
Well, that's not always the case.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.400
Oh, that's right...

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:08.830
Hinako-san, your jersey...

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:12.880
That time I had a flat, the cyclists
who helped me wore the same ones.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:16.420
You met some members of our team?

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:17.620
I knew it!

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:21.510
This is the Miko Cycling team jersey.

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:25.120
It's a community group of cycling enthusiasts.

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:30.240
We made it so we could recognize each other.

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.980
Made?

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:36.370
Wait! You can make your own jerseys?!

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:38.470
Sure. You can.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.640
That's amazing!

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:43.100
You can custom order them with your very own designs.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.480
Our very own designs?

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:52.230
A symbol of your friendship...

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.480
How nice...

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:59.030
Hey, look at the time.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.520
Shall we get going?

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:01.240
Yes!

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:16.910
Team jerseys...

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.620
Team jerseys, huh?

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:43.910
A symbol of your friendship...

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.160
Friends...

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:55.210
Then maybe it's okay to make something like that with the people I ride with...

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:02.220
I wonder how you order custom-made jerseys?

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:09.590
Let's see...

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:11.730
A minimum order of five...

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.420
Five means...

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:18.000
Me, Aoi-chan, Hinako-san...

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:20.810
Yayoi-san, and Saki-san...

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:23.370
Wow, that's perfect!

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:28.040
And it's way cheaper than I thought!

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.250
I expected a custom-order to be expensive!

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:32.650
Even I can afford this!

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:37.130
Wearing matching jerseys...

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:43.260
and some day...
participating in a flèche together...!

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:51.770
That sounds terrific!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.280
That would be awesome!

00:11:58.420 --> 00:11:59.650
Onee-chan...

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:02.070
What have you been up to?

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.660
You were watching?

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.910
You're scaring me. Are you okay?

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.640
Y-Yeah, I'm fine. Nothing's wrong!

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.910
Don't look at me like I'm crazy.

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:18.100
If you're tired, you should go to sleep soon.

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:19.000
O-Okay...

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.500
Good night.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:21.720
Night.

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:28.510
Okay!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.520
I'll ask everyone tomorrow...

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:36.390
But on second thought...

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:41.360
making a custom jersey is like
forcing everyone to buy one.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:46.280
Wouldn't I just be... troubling them?

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:52.750
What do I do?!
Should I forget it?!

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.870
Oh but but but but but...!

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:58.380
Are you sure you're okay?

00:12:58.380 --> 00:13:01.280
I-I-I-I... I said I'm fine!

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:11.270
But I really want matching jerseys for everyone.

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:15.310
I'll try... asking them tomorrow!

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:30.920
Look at those bags under her eyes.

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.540
But she's all smiles.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.470
Uh, Ami? Did something nice happen?

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:40.790
Oh, well... It's nothing like that.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:44.920
Um...

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:48.550
It may be selfish of me to ask, but...

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:53.180
Can we make our own original team jerseys, just for the five of us?

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:55.680
What's gotten into you all a sudden?

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:59.940
After seeing the people with team jerseys yesterday...

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:04.270
I thought it'd be great if we had
something like that for ourselves...

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:06.700
Original jerseys as a symbol of our friendship.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:11.200
You've taken me to so many places

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:15.410
and taught me so many things, and I'm so grateful.

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:17.960
So...

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:21.960
You guys have become very important to me.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:25.960
And I want a symbol of that bond.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:27.970
And...

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:32.010
And... I want us to wear those jerseys...

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:34.850
and participate in the next flèche.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:37.330
Oh my...

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:46.040
I see...

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:47.360
Ami.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.440
Yes?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:01.720
That's not possible.

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:08.510
I promise to do my best.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:10.970
Still, it's simply not possible.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.490
No...

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:16.020
After all,

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:18.850
you have to be at least 20 to participate in a flèche.

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:22.280
So...

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:26.110
when you and Aoi are 20,
let's ride in a flèche together.

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:29.110
And of course, we can all wear team jerseys.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.260
Yes! That sounds like fun!

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:33.320
Yeah, let's make them.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.240
Really?

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:36.490
Isn't that great, Ami?

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.040
Thank you!

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:42.340
Okay, what kind of jersey should we make?

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:43.080
Um...

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:48.500
Actually, I played around with some designs last night...

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.630
so I drew up a few.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:55.200
A few? These are all jersey designs?

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.060
Yes!

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:58.320
This many in just one night?

00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:00.300
That's terrific!

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:02.640
Motivated would be an understatement.

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:06.170
Wow, the illustrations are so detailed.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.650
Ami, who knew you had such talent.

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:12.050
I wouldn't go so far as to call it talent, but...

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:15.220
Ami has always loved drawing.

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:15.910
Yes!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:18.910
And this?

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:23.170
You have a wing-like mark in all the designs.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:27.420
Oh, that... I designed this while
imagining wings and the wind as a motif.

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:32.860
When I rode my road bike, I could
move forward effortlessly, as if I had grown wings.

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:35.910
The wind against my face made it feel like I was flying.

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:38.430
So I wanted to incorporate
that feeling into the design.

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:40.840
It's great!

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:41.930
How lovely!

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:46.700
So we can pick a design with that in mind,

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.500
but what about our team name?

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:49.940
Eh? Team name?

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:54.950
Wearing matching jerseys means we
belong to a team, a club, or a workshop.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.340
So there's usually a team name on it.

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:58.950
Oh, now that you mention it...

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:01.330
You didn't think of one?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.040
Not yet. I'm sorry...

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.160
Then let's think of one.

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:07.140
That's our homework for tomorrow.

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:12.270
I'm sorry.

00:17:12.270 --> 00:17:17.170
I got so excited about making matching jerseys...
I ran wild all by myself...

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:20.220
and ended up causing trouble for everyone...

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.440
I'm happy about it.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:25.940
If you hadn't taken up cycling,

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:30.360
I'd probably still be riding by myself.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:33.280
But since we began cycling together,

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:38.390
we've met Hinako-san, Yayoi-san, and Saki-san... and now there are five of us.

00:17:39.170 --> 00:17:43.010
Thanks to you, Ami, my own world has gotten bigger.

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:45.370
Cycling with friends is so much fun.

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:48.130
Aoi-chan!

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:52.380
A team name... I'll give it lots of thought.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:54.630
See you tomorrow.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:55.730
Okay!

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:09.040
Team Pedarunrun.

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:12.450
And you, Aoi?

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:13.150
Huh?!

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:19.140
Doesn't this name make
cycling sound fun? Isn't it cute?

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:21.290
If we're going for cute...

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:25.910
How about Sweet Angel?

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:27.950
Sweet Angel?

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:31.470
Or... Fai-Fairy Princess?

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:33.020
Fairy Princess?

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:34.550
Why are you repeating it?!

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:38.720
I'm surprised you can suggest names like that
without a hint of embarrassment.

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.000
Hinako-san, you're so cute.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.920
Hey, stop it!

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:44.010
What's important is...

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.270
Impact!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.940
Team: The Chowhounds!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:53.070
We're not all like you!

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:56.190
Okay, Team Ami-chan and Her Cheerful Friends.

00:18:57.320 --> 00:19:00.220
Sounds good, Ami's the one who
started this in the first place.

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:02.010
Right? Shall we decide on this?

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.530
I-I don't think...

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:08.750
Hold on, you're putting Ami on the spot.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:14.560
Say, Aoi... You really like Ami, don't you?

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:18.340
Aoi-chan is like Ami-chan's knight in shining armor.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:21.720
Aoi-chan is my knight?

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:25.310
Hey! Yayoi-san, what are you saying?!

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:27.720
We're discussing a team name here!

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:29.920
Do you have a suggestion, then?

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:35.980
How about this?

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:37.940
Team Amigo!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:40.490
Amigo! See, it's got Ami in it!

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:45.490
N-No! I don't mean it like that!
Amigo means friend in Spanish.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.270
Love, right?

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:50.980
It wasn't on purpose... I swear...

00:19:50.980 --> 00:19:52.120
And you, Yayoi?

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:55.200
How about Cassette Sprockets?

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:57.750
What does that mean?

00:19:58.290 --> 00:20:01.040
It's this gear on the rear wheel.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:03.760
It's my favorite bicycle part.

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:07.760
Look at these aesthetic ridges!

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:12.770
This beautiful form that was carefully conceived from the pursuit of functionality and delicacy!

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:15.780
Not only that, there are holes in it!

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:19.530
Each time you change gears,
the ridges fit perfectly into the grooves!

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:23.030
Stop! At this rate, we'll never decide.

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:27.400
What should we do?

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.390
Well then...

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:31.540
How about this?

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.040
What's this?

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.630
Fortuna.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:39.560
She is the goddess in Roman mythology that rules the Wheel of Fortune...

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:41.740
the personification of good luck.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:42.570
A goddess?

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:47.410
Wheels and good luck...
Words that fit cyclists like us perfectly, right?

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:52.230
Since we're all girls,
the name of a goddess also suits us.

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:56.060
It fits almost too perfectly.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:57.560
Well?

00:20:57.560 --> 00:20:59.610
Fortuna...

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:00.950
Fortuna!

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:18.080
I think it's wonderful!

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:21.230
I totally agree!

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:22.720
No objections here.

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:24.950
Then it's decided.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:29.930
Today marks the formation of Team Fortuna!

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.120
Yeah!

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:35.810
Okay, let's decide on a design that
incorporates our team name.

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:36.360
Ami?

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:37.100
Yes!

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:39.100
I'll leave drawing the concept art to you.

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:40.680
Eh, me?

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:44.500
Since we're making team jerseys,
we should have an original design.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:46.860
And you're the only one who can draw.

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:48.740
Ami, we're counting on you.

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:52.740
No one's ever depended on me before!

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:54.620
We're looking forward to it, Ami.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:55.870
Yes!

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:57.630
I'll do my very best!

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:32.370
Team Fortuna!

00:23:32.370 --> 00:23:35.470
We're goddesses! What a wonderful name!

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:38.430
But is it better than Pedarunrun?

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:41.250
I'll work hard to create a great jersey design!

00:23:41.250 --> 00:23:44.980
Next time on Long Riders: "The Team Bond."
